				<r3d:description language="eng">SimTK is a free project-hosting platform for the biomedical computation community that enables researchers to easily share their software, data, and models and provides the infrastructure so they can support and grow a community around their projects.
It has over 126.656 members, hosts 1.648 projects from researchers around the world, and has had more than 2.095.783 files downloaded from it. Individuals have created SimTK projects to meet publisher and funding agencies’ software and data sharing requirements, run scientific challenges, create a collection of their community’s resources, and much more.</r3d:description>
